NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY COLOUR DATA

This repository contains no colour-library data. The script
inkscape-print-libraries.sh downloads, at the user's request, the following
works and installs them unmodified:

  * HLC Colour Atlas - (c) freieFarbe e.V. - CC BY-ND 4.0
    https://www.freiefarbe.de/en/thema-farbe/hlc-colour-atlas/
  * Open Colour Systems Collection 2.0 - (c) dtp studio oldenburg - CC BY-ND 4.0
    https://freiefarbe.de/en/thema-farbe/software/

Their Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 terms apply to that data.
